Plants — add plants with name, species, experiment group, and notes. Click any plant to see its full sensor history and research notes
Sensor Data — log environmental readings (soil moisture, temperature, humidity, light) for any plant, with a filterable table view
AI Analysis — upload plant photos, record health scores, stress risk, growth stage, leaf condition, and analysis notes. Photos are stored and displayed in a gallery with detail views
Research — experiment groups overview (Control, Water Stress, Heat Stress, Combined Stress) with per-group stats, research question, hypothesis, and success criteria
Settings — profile info and sign-out
